<ul><li> Fix Last Talker setting problem.</li><li> Italian update from IZ2EIB.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/S2RJHRDQP8#1WTVOa6uQcFI" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/S2RJHRDQP8#1WTVOa6uQcFI</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/TJPJF51XAC#jSxZ1Ln9GyI9" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/TJPJF51XAC#jSxZ1Ln9GyI9</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/19, otherwise the APRS config won't work. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4773#p35193" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4773#p35193</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV and CPS XML files are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/Y6Q3ZDND7C#teUQ3T2TOpug" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/Y6Q3ZDND7C#teUQ3T2TOpug</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Wed Jan 22, 2025 5:07 pm</p><hr />
